const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"融资前的信息问题",en:"The information problem before financing"},body:{zh:"Healy与Palepu先讨论企业比投资者更了解项目质量的情形。外部投资者无法区分好坏项目时，会调整愿意支付的价格，优质项目也可能因此受损。披露在这里的作用是帮助区分质量，不只是增加报告篇幅或提高新闻曝光。",en:"The review begins with entrepreneurs knowing more than investors about project quality. When outsiders cannot distinguish projects, pricing can penalize good ones. Disclosure can help separate quality; that role is not equivalent to longer reports or greater media visibility."},reference:{url:"https://fenix.iseg.ulisboa.pt/downloadFile/1126033050841610/Healy%20and%20Palepu%202001%20(JAE).pdf",label:{zh:"2001年期刊版 · §2.1",en:"2001 journal article · §2.1"}}},{title:{zh:"融资后的激励问题",en:"The incentive problem after financing"},body:{zh:"资金投入之后，管理者的决策可能偏离外部投资者利益，形成代理问题。披露可支持监督合同履行和资源使用，但仍需要治理与执行机制。即使所有人知道同样的信息，也不意味着利益已经一致，信息问题与激励问题不能合并。",en:"After funding, managers may act against outside investors' interests. Disclosure supports monitoring of contracts and resources but still depends on governance and enforcement. Equal information does not guarantee aligned incentives, so information and agency problems remain distinct."},reference:{url:"https://fenix.iseg.ulisboa.pt/downloadFile/1126033050841610/Healy%20and%20Palepu%202001%20(JAE).pdf",label:{zh:"2001年期刊版 · §2.2",en:"2001 journal article · §2.2"}}},{title:{zh:"资金中介与信息中介各有角色",en:"Financial and information intermediaries have distinct roles"},body:{zh:"文中区分将储蓄转为企业资金的金融中介，以及分析、验证和传播企业信息的信息中介。分析师、审计和评级机制可以提高可信度，但它们也可能有自己的激励冲突。报告经过中介处理，并不自动成为没有偏差的信息。",en:"The framework distinguishes intermediaries channeling savings from those producing or validating information. Analysts, auditors and rating mechanisms can improve credibility, yet have their own incentive conflicts. Intermediation does not automatically turn a disclosure into unbiased information."},reference:{url:"https://fenix.iseg.ulisboa.pt/downloadFile/1126033050841610/Healy%20and%20Palepu%202001%20(JAE).pdf",label:{zh:"2001年期刊版 · §2 · Figure 1",en:"2001 journal article · §2 · Figure 1"}}},{title:{zh:"自愿披露本身就是一种选择",en:"Voluntary disclosure is itself a choice"},body:{zh:"管理者可能因融资交易、控制权、薪酬、诉讼或专有信息成本而改变披露。披露更积极的企业，往往也在其他方面不同。因此研究披露后结果时，不能把主动披露与随机分配的信息处理视为同一种研究设计。",en:"Financing transactions, control contests, compensation, litigation and proprietary costs can affect disclosure choices. Firms disclosing more may differ along many other dimensions. Studying subsequent outcomes is therefore not equivalent to randomly assigning an information treatment."},reference:{url:"https://fenix.iseg.ulisboa.pt/downloadFile/1126033050841610/Healy%20and%20Palepu%202001%20(JAE).pdf",label:{zh:"2001年期刊版 · §5.2.1",en:"2001 journal article · §5.2.1"}}},{title:{zh:"管理层预测只是披露的一种代理",en:"Management forecasts proxy only part of disclosure"},body:{zh:"盈利预测的时间和数字通常较清楚，后来也容易与实际结果对照，这给研究带来优势。但客户满意度、人力资本等披露不一定具有同样可验证性。以盈利预测得到的结论，不能直接推广为所有企业文本或所有披露方式的效果。",en:"Management forecasts often have clear timing and numerical outcomes that can later be checked. Other disclosures, such as customer satisfaction or human capital, may be harder to verify. Evidence from earnings forecasts cannot automatically generalize to every corporate text or disclosure channel."},reference:{url:"https://fenix.iseg.ulisboa.pt/downloadFile/1126033050841610/Healy%20and%20Palepu%202001%20(JAE).pdf",label:{zh:"2001年期刊版 · §5.2.3 · p. 426",en:"2001 journal article · §5.2.3 · p. 426"}}},{title:{zh:"读披露研究，要同时读测量与识别",en:"Read measurement and identification alongside disclosure findings"},body:{zh:"综述明确指出许多研究存在内生性和测量误差。编辑解读：文本长度、词频或评级得分究竟代理什么，需要先说清；随后再判断披露是原因、结果还是共同变化。更多文字可能是更多信息，也可能是更复杂业务或更高披露负担。",en:"The review explicitly highlights endogeneity and measurement error. Editorial reading: establish what length, word counts or ratings proxy before deciding whether disclosure is a cause, consequence or correlate. More text can reflect information, business complexity or a heavier reporting burden."},reference:{url:"https://fenix.iseg.ulisboa.pt/downloadFile/1126033050841610/Healy%20and%20Palepu%202001%20(JAE).pdf",label:{zh:"2001年期刊版 · p. 407; §5.2.3",en:"2001 journal article · p. 407; §5.2.3"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"披露数量、披露可信度与信息不对称不是同一个变量。研究综述强调内生性和测量误差，观察到披露与融资成本相关不等于已经识别因果。",en:"Disclosure quantity, credibility and information asymmetry are different variables. The review emphasizes endogeneity and measurement error; association with financing costs is not causal identification."}};export{e as default};
